playbook. v2 is organised by task ("I want to…") with steps and one
watch-out each, a first 15 minutes, who can do what, the morning check,
rules and a glossary; v3 is one page. Generated by
scripts/guides/admin_guideline_versions.py, reusing the playbook
versions' components.

